<title>UK: TABLE - ICI posts Q1 65 mln stg pretax profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ICI posts Q1 65 mln stg pretax profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter</p>
<p>		    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.0		    vs 15.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     65		     vs 202</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,439		  vs 2,568</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results exclude exceptionals. Including exceptionals, pretax profit was 70 million stg versus 223 million stg.</p>
<p>ICI said the pound's strength hurt Q1 profits by about 40 million stg versus the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 75.0 and 90.0 million stg, with the consensus around 79.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Imperial Chemical Industries Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
